1. PROJECT VISION

Build a complete, professional, modern, responsive enterprise AI web application called NexaKnowledge AI.

NexaKnowledge AI is an intelligent business platform that combines:

Enterprise AI Knowledge Assistant.

Company Policy Intelligence.

Advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

Document Intelligence.

Business Intelligence and Analytics.

AI-powered Dashboard Generation.

AI Report Generation.

Voice-enabled AI Assistant.

The platform should allow businesses to upload documents, company policies, reports, spreadsheets and datasets, ask questions using text or voice, analyze their business information, generate dashboards and download reports.

The platform must work for different types of businesses, not just one company or industry.

It should be designed as a universal enterprise knowledge and business intelligence platform.

