Voice examples

User: "Explain my company's leave policy."

AI retrieves the uploaded leave policy and speaks the grounded answer with its document citation.

User: "Show me the top five products by revenue."

AI analyzes the actual dataset, displays a product chart and speaks a short summary.

User: "Generate a monthly business report."

AI creates the report and speaks a brief confirmation when the report is ready.

The application must show the written transcription and answer even when voice playback is enabled.

Allow users to stop playback and request a shorter spoken summary.

